{"call_id": "EVAL-CTX-1-5d52", "ani": "+61000000", "history": [{"role": "user", "content": "Hi, my name is Jane Doe and my date of birth is 22 July 1990. I'm with Sydney Heart Centre. I was calling about an order I placed recently."}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Hi Jane, thanks for confirming \u2014 you\u2019re verified, and I\u2019m here to help with your HeartBug account."}, {"role": "user", "content": "I think it's been a week since I ordered it, but the system still says \"processing\". Can you tell me when it'll actually arrive?"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "I can see your Replacement Device is still processing and is due on 2 August, while your Electrode Stickers have shipped and your HeartBug Monitor was already delivered."}, {"role": "user", "content": "So the stickers have arrived then - who's delivering my replacement device on the 2nd of August? Is it a courier or someone from HeartBug directly?"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Your Replacement Device is still processing, and I don\u2019t have a carrier or tracking yet \u2014 it\u2019s currently due on 2 August."}, {"role": "user", "content": "But you said the stickers had shipped... does that mean there's some delay with getting the shipping information for my replacement device, too?"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Your replacement device is still processing, so there isn\u2019t any shipping information or carrier yet, and the current delivery date is 2 August."}, {"role": "user", "content": "I'd like to track it once I have a tracking number - will I be able to do that online, or should I call back here again?"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Once your Replacement Device has a tracking number, you\u2019ll be able to track it online, and if you\u2019d like, you can call HeartBug back here anytime for an update."}], "escalation": {"verify_stuck": 0, "task_failures": {"verify_identity": 0, "list_orders": 0, "lookup_order": 0}, "out_of_scope": 0}, "note": {"entities": [{"id": "O10