{"call_id": "EVAL-KB-1-cb0b", "ani": "+61498765432", "history": [{"role": "user", "content": "I don't have my information ready, can I just ask about some general usage questions instead?"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Of course \u2014 HeartBug can help with general usage questions, and I can also tell you that it\u2019s used by people of all ages for longer-term heart rhythm monitoring, especially when symptoms come and go."}, {"role": "user", "content": "Can I record while my screen is off? I'd like to track things at night without being bothered."}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Yes \u2014 manual recordings keep running even if your screen is off or the app is in the background, so you can track at night without being bothered."}, {"role": "user", "content": "Does it still work in airplane mode, or do I need Wi-Fi for it to sync and send data?"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Yes \u2014 HeartBug works without Wi\u2011Fi or mobile signals, and it only needs Bluetooth to sync to your phone; your phone just needs internet later to upload the recordings automatically when you reconnect."}], "escalation": {"verify_stuck": 0, "task_failures": {"search_kb": 0}, "out_of_scope": 0}, "note": {"entities": [], "actions": []}}
