{"call_id": "EVAL-KB-1-848b", "ani": "+61498765432", "history": [{"role": "user", "content": "No, that information isn't required for my question; can I record while my screen is off?"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Yes \u2014 if you\u2019re doing a manual recording on HeartBug, it keeps running even with the screen off or the app in the background."}, {"role": "user", "content": "Does it still work in airplane mode, even though the Bluetooth connection is lost?"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Yes \u2014 HeartBug can keep recording without your phone, and if Bluetooth drops it stores the data and uploads it automatically when you reconnect."}, {"role": "user", "content": "What's the price of ten kilos of mango?"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "I\u2019m sorry, but I only handle HeartBug account matters; if you\u2019d like, I can help with your HeartBug account or put you through to the right team."}, {"role": "user", "content": "Can I get a general answer about the 10 kilogram price on something not related to HeartBug?"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "I\u2019m sorry, but I can only help with HeartBug account matters; if you\u2019d like, I can help with something on your HeartBug account or connect you to the team."}, {"role": "user", "content": "I think there's been a misunderstanding \u2013 my question about mango wasn't related to HeartBug at all; what happens when the recording storage is almost full?"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "If HeartBug\u2019s storage gets close to full, it can hold about 40 recordings, and once it\u2019s full the oldest recordings are overwritten unless they\u2019ve already synced to your phone, in which case they\u2019re safely stored."}, {"role": "user", "content": "Will a factory reset on my phone delete any HeartBug data or recordings?"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "A factory reset on your phone won\u2019t delete HeartBug\u2019s stored recordings, since the data stays on the device until it reconnects and