{"call_id": "EVAL-KB-1-ec60", "ani": "+61498765432", "history": [{"role": "user", "content": "No, I just need some general information about the app and device. Can I record while my screen is off?"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Yes, manual recordings keep running even if your screen is off or the app is in the background."}, {"role": "user", "content": "That's good to know. Does it still work in airplane mode, since I sometimes have trouble getting a signal at home?"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Yes, HeartBug manual recordings still work in airplane mode, and they\u2019ll upload automatically once your phone reconnects to the internet."}, {"role": "user", "content": "What's the price of ten kilos of mango?"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "I\u2019m sorry, but I can only help with HeartBug account matters; if you\u2019d like, I can assist with your account or put you through to the right team."}, {"role": "user", "content": "That's not what I'm looking for then. Can you just give me a minute, please?"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Of course \u2014 take your time, and when you\u2019re ready I can help with any HeartBug account matter, or I can put you through to the right team."}, {"role": "user", "content": "Never mind, I'll just go ahead and ask again: how do I sync my recordings from a different device?"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "HeartBug recordings sync by Bluetooth to your phone, and if Bluetooth fails, restarting your phone and reopening the app usually reconnects them so they can upload when your phone has internet."}, {"role": "user", "content": "What happens if I reset the HeartBug device itself? Will that wipe all my recordings?"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "If the HeartBug device is returned, it\u2019s fully wiped and reset, so no previous patient data remains."}], "escalation": {"verify_stuck": 0, "task_failures": {"search_kb": 0}, "out_of_scope": 0}, "note": {"entities": [], "actions": []}}
