{"call_id": "EVAL-KB-1-9815", "ani": "+61498765432", "history": [{"role": "user", "content": "No, actually I'm just having some trouble with the app and was hoping for general information on its capabilities."}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Of course\u2014HeartBug captures your ECG with the wearable, sends it through the app for secure upload and clinician review, and the app itself doesn\u2019t track your location or personal activities."}, {"role": "user", "content": "That's reassuring to hear. Can I record while my screen is off?"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Yes\u2014manual recordings keep running even if your screen is off or the app is in the background, and they\u2019ll still work without Wi\u2011Fi, in airplane mode, or while charging."}, {"role": "user", "content": "Does it still work in airplane mode?"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Yes\u2014HeartBug can keep recording without your phone, and it syncs once you\u2019re back in Bluetooth range, while your phone uploads when it has internet again."}, {"role": "user", "content": "What's the price of ten kilos of mango?"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "I\u2019m sorry, but I can only help with HeartBug account matters; if you\u2019d like, I can help with your HeartBug account or put you through to the right team."}, {"role": "user", "content": "This is a little off-topic, I know, but I'm still using my old phone and it doesn't have Bluetooth anymore. Can that be an issue with syncing?"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Yes, that can affect syncing\u2014if Bluetooth isn\u2019t available or is off, recordings won\u2019t sync to your phone, but the device will keep storing them until it reconnects."}, {"role": "user", "content": "I don't have any issues with syncing so far, thankfully. Can I also export my ECG records in a format like PDF?"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Absolutely, and before we go further, may I have the full name on the HeartBug account please?"}], "escalation": {"ver