{"call_id": "EVAL-CTX-1-f5bf", "ani": "+61000000", "history": [{"role": "user", "content": "My name is Jane Doe, my date of birth is 22nd July 1990, and I'm under care with the Sydney Heart Centre."}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Thanks, Jane \u2014 you\u2019re verified with HeartBug, and I\u2019m here to help."}, {"role": "user", "content": "I've got an order from a few days ago that's supposed to arrive soon - can you tell me when it will be delivered?"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Your HeartBug Monitor was already delivered on July 8, your Electrode Stickers were shipped and are due on July 30, and your Replacement Device is still processing with an estimated delivery of August 2."}, {"role": "user", "content": "I think there might have been some mistake about the monitor - I'm not sure why it would've arrived that early since my doctor said I needed to replace it with a newer model. What's going on with that?"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "I can confirm the HeartBug Monitor on that order was delivered by StarTrack on July 8, and I don\u2019t have any information here about why your doctor recommended a newer model. If you\u2019d like, I can help with the replacement device order or connect you with the team."}, {"role": "user", "content": "I think it's just a mix-up - my doctor said that when we spoke about it on July 15. Anyway, the Replacement Device is still processing, right? Who's handling that delivery then, is it StarTrack again?"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Yes, the Replacement Device is still processing and it\u2019s estimated to arrive on August 2, and I don\u2019t have a carrier or tracking number for it yet."}, {"role": "user", "content": "So there won't be any tracking information available until after it's shipped, okay - how do I know when it's actually shipped then?"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Once the Replacement Device ships, you\u2019ll get the tracking details then, and if you\u2019d like I can help check anything else on your HeartBug account or put you through to the team."}], "escalation": {"verify_stuck": 0, "task_failures": {"verify_identity": 0, "list_orders": 0, "lookup_order": 0, "search_kb": 0}, "out_of_scope": 0}, "note": {"entities": [{"id": "O1004", "product": "Electrode Stickers", "status": "shipped", "carrier": "Australia Post", "tracking": "AP1004AU", "eta": "2026-07-30"}, {"id": "O1003", "product": "HeartBug Monitor", "status": "delivered", "carrier": "StarTrack", "tracking": "ST1003AU", "eta": "2026-07-08"}, {"id": "O1005", "product": "Replacement Device", "status": "processing", "eta": "2026-08-02"}], "actions": ["caller verified as a patient"]}}
