on regimen logged in HeartBug; if you\u2019d like, I can help you with anything else on their account or put you through to the team."}, {"role": "user", "content": "That's fine, I'll just access it from my patient records here at the clinic - no worries at all, thank you for checking."}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "That works perfectly\u2014thank you for letting me know, and if you need anything else with your HeartBug account, I\u2019m here to help."}], "escalation": {"verify_stuck": 0, "task_failures": {"verify_identity": 0, "check_patient_status": 0, "send_patient_report": 0, "check_patient_alerts": 0, "search_kb": 0}, "out_of_scope": 0}, "note": {"entities": [{"id": "Alex Thompson"}], "actions": ["caller verified as a doctor"]}}
