{"call_id": "EVAL-CTX-1-f913", "ani": "+61000000", "history": [{"role": "user", "content": "Hi, my name is Jane Doe, and I was born on 22nd July 1990. I'm a patient at the Sydney Heart Centre. Can you tell me about order O1003 that's supposed to be on its way to me?"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Thanks, Jane \u2014 to help with your HeartBug account, could you please tell me which HeartBug clinic you\u2019re registered with?"}, {"role": "user", "content": "I'm a patient at the Sydney Heart Centre, so I'm all set there. Now, about that order... when will it arrive?"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Thanks, and I have your note that you\u2019re registered with Sydney Heart Centre; to help with HeartBug, could you please tell me which clinic is on your record?"}, {"role": "user", "content": "Sydney Heart Centre again - no change there. So, can you tell me who's going to be delivering it when it arrives?"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Thanks, Jane \u2014 you\u2019re verified, and I\u2019m here to help, though I don\u2019t have that delivery detail right now; I can help with anything else on your HeartBug account or put you through to the team."}, {"role": "user", "content": "That's fine, thanks for checking. Can you please tell me how I can track it once it's shipped? Is there a way to keep an eye on its progress?"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "You can track it in the HeartBug app using \u201cSee My Heart\u201d to view a live trace, and if you can\u2019t see a trace or there\u2019s no connection, please contact patient care."}, {"role": "user", "content": "So I'll be able to see where it is in real-time through the app - but what about updates on delivery attempts? Will I get notified somehow if someone tries to deliver it when I'm not home?"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "I don\u2019t have a delivery-attempt notification to confirm, but if you\u2019d like I can help with anything else on your HeartBug account or put you through to the team."}], "escalation": {"verify_stuck": 0, "task_failures": {"verify_identity": 0, "search_kb": 0}, "out_of_scope": 0}, "note": {"entities": [], "actions": ["caller verified as a patient"]}}
