{"call_id": "EVAL-CTX-1-f913", "ani": "+61000000", "history": [{"role": "user", "content": "Hi, my name is Jane Doe, and I was born on 22nd July 1990. I'm a patient at the Sydney Heart Centre. Can you tell me about order O1003 that's supposed to be on its way to me?"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Thanks, Jane \u2014 to help with your HeartBug account, could you please tell me which HeartBug clinic you\u2019re registered with?"}, {"role": "user", "content": "I'm a patient at the Sydney Heart Centre, so I'm all set there. Now, about that order... when will it arrive?"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Thanks, and I have your note that you\u2019re registered with Sydney Heart Centre; to help with HeartBug, could you please tell me which clinic is on your record?"}, {"role": "user", "content": "Sydney Heart Centre again - no change there. So, can you tell me who's going to be delivering it when it arrives?"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Thanks, Jane \u2014 you\u2019re verified, and I\u2019m here to help, though I don\u2019t have that delivery detail right now; I can help with anything else on your HeartBug account or put you through to the team."}, {"role": "user", "content": "That's fine, thanks for checking. Can you please tell me how I can track it once it's shipped? Is there a way to keep an eye on its progress?"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "You can track it in the HeartBug app using \u201cSee My Heart\u201d to view a live trace, and if you can\u2019t see a trace or there\u2019s no connection, please contact patient care."}, {"role": "user", "content": "So I'll be able to see where it is in real-time through the app - but what about updates on delivery attempts? Will I get notified somehow if someone tries to deliver it when I'm not home?"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "I don\u2019t have a delivery-attempt notification to confirm, but if you\u2019d like I can help with anything else on your HeartBug account or put you through to the team."}, {"role": "user", "content": "That's okay, thanks for looking into it. Can you at least tell me what address they'll be delivering it to? Is it still my home address that's linked to my account?"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "I can confirm your recent HeartBug orders are a delivered monitor, shipped electrode stickers, and a replacement device still processing, but I can\u2019t see the delivery address from here. If you\u2019d like, I can help with anything else on your HeartBug account or put you through to the team."}], "escalation": {"verify_stuck": 0, "task_failures": {"verify_identity": 0, "search_kb": 0, "list_orders": 0}, "out_of_scope": 0}, "note": {"entities": [{"id": "O1003", "product": "HeartBug Monitor", "status": "delivered", "carrier": "StarTrack", "tracking": "ST1003AU", "eta": "2026-08-04"}, {"id": "O1004", "product": "Electrode Stickers", "status": "shipped", "carrier": "Australia Post", "tracking": "AP1004AU", "eta": "2026-08-26"}, {"id": "O1005", "product": "Replacement Device", "status": "processing", "eta": "2026-08-29"}], "actions": ["caller verified as a patient"]}}
