 and 5:00 PM, and the time you\u2019ve asked for is already in the past, so please choose a weekday time within those hours."}, {"role": "user", "content": "ok so 3pm is ok"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Perfect, I\u2019ve moved your HeartBug callback to 3:00 PM on 28 August 2026, and a staff member will call you within about 30 minutes of then."}, {"role": "user", "content": "I have another callback schedule CB-7CEB6E, can I cancel it?"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "I\u2019m sorry, but I can\u2019t cancel that callback from here because I\u2019m not able to find it; if you\u2019d like, I can help with something else on your HeartBug account or put you through to the team."}, {"role": "user", "content": "how many schedule do I have?"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "I can\u2019t see how many callbacks you have from here, so I\u2019m not able to confirm that for you. If you\u2019d like, I can help with something else on your HeartBug account or put you through to the team."}], "escalation": {"verify_stuck": 0, "task_failures": {"verify_identity": 0, "search_kb": 0, "request_callback": 0, "confirmation": 1, "submit_callback": 0, "reschedule_callback": 0, "submit_reschedule": 0, "cancel_callback": 1, "get_my_callback": 1}, "out_of_scope": 0}, "note": {"entities": [], "actions": ["caller verified as a patient", "caller answered 'yes' to the request_callback confirmation"]}}
