{"call_id": "EVAL-CROSS-1-f3c2", "ani": "+61498765432", "history": [{"role": "user", "content": "This is Jane Doe, born on July 22nd, 1990 - what's this about a welcome? I'm calling because my device isn't working right. Can you help me with that?"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "I can help with that\u2014please turn Bluetooth on, keep your phone close, open the HeartBug app, and if it still won\u2019t reconnect, restart your phone and reopen the app."}, {"role": "user", "content": "That's not what I'm calling about, my device is working fine - I want to know why you've got an order for me with number O1002 on file? What is that all about?"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Thanks, Jane, you\u2019re verified with HeartBug, and I\u2019m here to help; I can\u2019t see what that order is for from here, but I can connect you to the right team or help with anything else on your HeartBug account."}, {"role": "user", "content": "No, no, no - I want to know about O1002, who's it for? It says \"Jane Doe\" and my name is Jane Doe - what's going on, why does it have that number on it?"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "I understand this is frustrating, but I can\u2019t find order O1002 on HeartBug\u2019s side, so please double-check the order number, and if you\u2019d like, I can help with something else on your account or connect you to the team."}, {"role": "user", "content": "That's ridiculous, I know it says O1002 - my device must have malfunctioned and put it there by mistake... Can you check again? It's definitely an order for me..."}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "I can hear how frustrating this is, but I still can\u2019t find order O1002 on HeartBug\u2019s side, so please double-check the number; if you want, I can help with something else on your account or put you through to the team."}, {"role": "user", "content": "How am I supposed to know it's not for me? You people must have gotten my information mixed up - just check again, and this time make sure you're getting it right!"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "I hear your frustration, and I can connect you with the HeartBug team now to check this properly\u2014would you like me to connect you now, or schedule a callback for later?"}], "escalation": {"verify_stuck": 0, "task_failures": {"connect_now": 0}, "out_of_scope": 0}, "note": {"entities": [], "actions": ["caller verified as a patient"]}, "_pending_confirm": {"domain": "booking", "tool": "connect_now", "args": {"queue": "patient_support", "reason": "task_failure \u2014 so far: ACTION: caller verified as a patient \u2014 caller said: No, no, no - I want to know about O1002, who's it for? It says \"Jane Doe\" and my name is Jane Doe - what's going on, why does it have that number on it? | That's ridiculous, I know it says O1002 - my device must have malfunctioned and put it there by mistake... Can you check again? It's definitely an order for me... | How am I supposed to know it's not for me? You people must have gotten my information mixed up - just check again, and this time make sure you're getting it right!"}, "answers": {"yes": {"action": "escalate", "event": "handoff", "hint": "the caller wants to be connected to a person now"}, "no": {"action": "call_tool", "tool": "request_callback", "hint": "the caller would rather schedule a callback for later"}}, "prompt": "I hear your frustration, and I can connect you with the HeartBug team now to check this properly\u2014would you like me to connect you now, or schedule a callback for later?"}}
