: "Don't hang up on me! I want to speak directly to the person in charge of orders - can you transfer me to their extension instead? And make sure they know about order O1002..."}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "I\u2019m sorry, but I can\u2019t transfer you to a specific extension, and I don\u2019t have any order details beyond order O1002; I can still connect you with the HeartBug team now if you\u2019d like."}], "escalation": {"verify_stuck": 0, "task_failures": {"connect_now": 0}, "out_of_scope": 0}, "note": {"entities": [], "actions": ["caller verified as a patient", "caller answered 'now' to the connect_now confirmation"]}, "_pending_confirm": {"domain": "booking", "tool": "connect_now", "args": {"queue": "patient_support", "reason": "voluntary \u2014 so far: ACTION: caller verified as a patient ; ACTION: caller answered 'now' to the connect_now confirmation \u2014 caller said: But that's not my problem - I've already told you it's O1002! Can't you just look it up properly? I need to know where this order is and when it'll be arriving... | I don't want to wait for a callback, just connect me through to them now. I need this resolved ASAP and I'm not leaving until someone looks into order O1002 for me. | Don't hang up on me! I want to speak directly to the person in charge of orders - can you transfer me to their extension instead? And make sure they know about order O1002..."}, "answers": {"now": {"action": "escalate", "event": "handoff", "hint": "the caller wants to be connected to a person now"}, "later": {"action": "call_tool", "tool": "request_callback", "hint": "the caller would rather schedule a callback for later"}, "decline": {"action": "escalate", "event": "handoff", "hint": "the caller wants NEITHER, no transfer and no callback (e.g. 'no need for that', 'just look again', 'no thanks')"}}, "prompt": "I\u2019m sorry, but I can\u2019t transfer you to a specific extension, and I don\u2019t have any order details beyond order O1002; I can still connect 